complaint and not just some

388
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:46,780
general vague kind of
sort of hurts like that.

389
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:52,860
There can be lots of causes
for instability. Most

390
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:56,180
obvious is severe trauma.
Bony metastases can do it too,

391
00:19:56,180 --> 00:19:58,240
but we're just going to
talk about two general

392
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:02,260
