mentioning whiplash at least.

439
00:22:19,620 --> 00:22:22,380
Usually from a rear impact
collision in a motor vehicle

440
00:22:22,380 --> 00:22:25,560
accident the whole head
and neck whip forward and

441
00:22:25,560 --> 00:22:28,040
then because the distal c
-spine is more mobile and it

442
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:31,080
has this weight at its end
it starts to rebound first

443
00:22:31,080 --> 00:22:33,480
and then finally the motion
carries through to the

444
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:36,040
lower c-spine and that extends
too. So there literally

445
00:22:36,040 --> 00:22:39,240
is this whipping motion.
No one really knows if the

446
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:42,760
