traumatic with fractures. I've

450
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:57,180
never seen a fracture on a
whiplash, but they happen.

451
00:22:57,860 --> 00:23:00,600
Overall, however, the
prognosis is very good and

452
00:23:00,600 --> 00:23:02,580
